{"job_id":"F-1c04c85402466a091a08","family_id":"F-1c04c85402466a091a08","title":"해군함대령","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":5,"target_id":"1fc11e765337eaf12cb8a67fd882931a15874deef7395142fb92d2a39b07468a","source_hash":"f3e2d9ed6a6ec4eaeb01d2e8703e58a31471de79dc0021e81e05f661dbca9efe","text":"海军舰队指挥官"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":96,"target_id":"9d6fb4c164a361ec5318cb466721877a413bad1a7b555b9c902490fce6418b6a","source_hash":"5d19faff466c10e25ff4fed3e9c88d06db55d58524ed85e8a936ad9f593b6881","text":"第 1 条（安装和任务）\n①海军应建立一支海军舰队（以下简称“舰队”）。\n② 舰队负责其管辖范围内下属或附属部队的作战和训练以及军事行政事务。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":96,"end":197,"target_id":"1a1d4cf5fb79399093240e5111b49360c343e96eebb2e41a62d63233f628cdc2","source_hash":"a87be9a014e2dffbddd1bb7d5e328769c989f949e57e46681af7bcf8a654bf11","text":"第二条（名称、作战管辖权等）各舰队的名称由总统决定，作战管辖权分为陆地管辖权和海洋管辖权，由直接上级军官决定；其他管辖权由海军作战部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":197,"end":352,"target_id":"29ca0f7d8ccd0b98921d95a19f34f74412918f67bc7648f1c8a7c8dbaf3c3d7a","source_hash":"0b51303afe0a6c27a21ae03f617008ec9c3a9930caddfd9a64715814d35f5081","text":"第三条（指挥官等的任命）\n① 每个舰队应设舰队指挥部（以下简称“指挥部”）及必要的部队。\n②司令部设司令官、副司令官和参谋长。\n③ 司令员应从海军将官中任命，副司令员和参谋长应从海军将官或校级军官中任命。<2024年9月26日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":352,"end":497,"target_id":"980c6ecbaa436824088fa1697faa294ef98f6926ef78afdc23800224ca900a6a","source_hash":"d30fdf807add90350148a88cb5bac237585d414922cd9c592b9a00bd2315ac54","text":"第四条（指挥官等的职责）\n①사령관은 사령부의 업무를 통할하고 함대에 예속 또는 배속된 부대를 지휘ㆍ감독한다.\n②부사령관은 사령관을 보좌하며, 사령관이 사고가 있을 때에는 그 직무를 대행한다.\n③참모장은 사령관을 보좌하며, 참모업무를 조정ㆍ통제 및 감독한다.\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":497,"end":594,"target_id":"3d96f916c30f9ad08951a12a49c246d66b6a91ef23d95aee37366a7ec15d07d6","source_hash":"0911e14d921a0eb4de2a74f69a9418d748f0c7344067dfaf1747addce604f73a","text":"第五条（维护军纪）司令官应当维护和执行其管辖范围内海军部队的军纪。但是，海军作战部长特别指定的海军部队除外。<2018年12月4日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":594,"end":757,"target_id":"91ef6810890c5634ee4f73539b811656138f195e300c5ea2bef7c59fdde3d0d8","source_hash":"964c6634855a87c7401e1feed92d00ce4cb363ec85cc38e4455025f3c7f7e84b","text":"第六条（军事紧急措施等）\n① 在因军事或灾害原因需要采取紧急措施的情况下，指挥官可以暂时指挥和监督其管辖范围内的单位以外的其他单位。\n② 对于第 1 款所述情况，指挥官应立即向上级报告情况，并通知有关单位的上级单位指挥官。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":757,"end":838,"target_id":"f6a4c301b5c1c22307cd705bf3066c07fe573d7c96c19b9e436d89ec5d2295ce","source_hash":"7c3add3a110c35801658bf4221ac5ab6bcd0a63c1811825659bb57b6ac156c74","text":"第七条（指挥部调动的事先批准）  指挥官因灾害或军事需要拟调动指挥部时，必须事先获得其直接上级的批准。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":838,"end":955,"target_id":"7986ca30e69303235e6894d73f1bf650de4d2fe1e7ae8d2b2ee085f2166449a5","source_hash":"a9dea168fdeb1b7bf0a046524b1cfbf6384ca1ba5807f54676d37f2230145adf","text":"第八条（部门和单位的设立）\n①在总部建立必要的部门和单位。\n② 根据第1款规定设立部门和划分职责的事项，由海军作战部长决定；部队的设立、任务和组织事项，由国防部长决定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":955,"end":999,"target_id":"4ddd59197fa1f7c35285ff05b64a31da789e9aec0b9f146c92d0d4e2c5f1491b","source_hash":"32ce85438cfb84d4d4c6cf05ab8257900aca2ce4978dd6849a996d8986a5bc72","text":"第九条（人员配额）各舰队的军事人员和文职人员配额由国防部长确定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":999,"end":1050,"target_id":"172ebc781778c501a5349b8c5af7705136d39fed67dd663b54cea3c9bfcbc80b","source_hash":"b781caa6506730acca5b97d138bde6d5b1d90b66f3a6685df2503db610243b7a","text":"补充规定 <第13128号，1990年9月29日>\n\n本法令自1990年10月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1050,"end":1083,"target_id":"b539ee4a981d4699b5c2701b97fca423d1aa6c898b51223bd6a00fadf690d7d3","source_hash":"46ae83072f863724fe582dfad77d64d08ffc2625dcab5f104235e03aafc9074d","text":"补充条款（《军事人员法》实施令）<第28266号，2017年9月5日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1083,"end":1120,"target_id":"ca6b697bc6bcd951ec2ec5633fa5eb0ffdd03825ec9dccbae160c39f49008924","source_hash":"7d7075d3fab665cdbaac560b14335b0ee552583c1a51db7e92e263494f72f34f","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1120,"end":1134,"target_id":"07cac4fb38ab1091576becc50dbca9e4e1e2c02ea71c86a3e5a28291dd88bf7c","source_hash":"c27a8d90e2fad39db31a7ec7c05311572dbb07d5ec24565e9bc0e8ebd63ca618","text":"第 2 条和第 3 条已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1134,"end":1251,"target_id":"a778c8e15770e3fa0b874e341f7cddda0ad9165a37ae7c3d18a8ab889343e4f8","source_hash":"04a8dc761770283d611236d275055a8d32271cdcf59e3cbab0ad5b886bd590f4","text":"第四条（修改其他法律）①至<85>款省略\n\n  <86> 海军舰队命令部分修订如下。\n\n  第3条第3款中的“部级”应改为“总级”。\n\n  <87> 至 <90> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1251,"end":1283,"target_id":"ff7cb64747a111568b91c420b42edbefce5fb9c56216f1ba30da9a8973ae6a80","source_hash":"de588adf60e2b9ab1eae09f068dfaec85007d837e2e47e4243decc39ddef51a7","text":"增补（作战指挥令）<编号 29321，2018 年 12 月 4 日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1283,"end":1318,"target_id":"b39c44909a1699de38584a10ef2a65ee70f8aa3070d86144fe981a015042e1ab","source_hash":"cd0498143f8ddb81f650d569a11c16e832dab70e6930facb820e7b6bf2e62145","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2019年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1318,"end":1326,"target_id":"afbc81c58d136ae35978288254958d89f811b4797a2aac6f1009299a1db6ac47","source_hash":"1fa2d78222cc5f3a7b268ba3015a524a8e57a9355a8b17e0ae4253566ef34323","text":"第 2 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1326,"end":1472,"target_id":"8eeec5fdd7b6dab4b1d20f7972351128a6b499782ba95bbdc8c0d933369cf2f5","source_hash":"bb6d8d114ad20e386262c47baf7208aa1b6cc9eb90a4bc5678845ffaed703f7b","text":"第三条（修改其他法律）①至⑭ 已省略\n\n  ⑮ 海军舰队命令部分内容修订如下。 \n\n  第五条的标题“（维持军纪）”应改为“（维持军纪）”，并且在同一条的正文中，除标题外，“军纪”应改为“军纪（军纪）”。\n\n  <16> 省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1472,"end":1480,"target_id":"a3fea6452b1890a539830727e9f0cbb5d9f48af2caf8f105af4d9f8e2e2155d2","source_hash":"bc28291f8a8368cab289540ec155c57b21b6d38387b73664ba08b936ee269006","text":"第 4 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005550-265537-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1480,"end":1565,"target_id":"b39ea4f4eb449c059635760d6e352568a7fd9b6e8d1df2aec50b8dd22e534035","source_hash":"f9ae94fb82ee6b9f5449b52ca8fd1939ab32262dfc2c19a1e410b091d84617f9","text":"增补（关于部分修改六项法律以提高军事组织运作效率的总统令）<第34908号，2024年9月26日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。"}]}